  shortDescription: High-altitude heavy-grey dunes with razor crests.
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Early exploration biome. Come here to learn routes, gather basics,
    and follow strong natural shapes and search obvious pockets.
  commonRewardHook: Common runs pay out in Silica Shards and Copper Ore.
  rareRewardHook: 'Rare pull is modest: Electrolyte Salts and Sealant Pack.'
  landmarkIdentity: Silt Dunes reads through spires, steps, and big natural crowns.
    Landmarks should feel bright and readable.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets are frequent. The player should often see a clear
    reset point nearby.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: bad drops and exposed lines. Creature pressure
    stays low_to_medium.'
  extractionFocus: 'Broad sweep collection, light salvage, and scattered node stops.
    Early tier: keep runs short and favor stone pockets and hard-form nodes.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is basin lip or dune crest line. This slot
    should read through soft bowls and ripple seams; use vertical forms to keep heading.
